    "reviews": [
      {
        "author_name": "Stefania Jones",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/117070522681870274175/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXn4BTt9HNzAbRX-DAI9d1ojOEzqXKxonxUsIBQ9tP41xz9yr_HLA=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "2 months ago",
        "text": "I’ve been taking cats to see Dr. Dina, Dr. Sarah, & Dr. Feeby. They’ve been delightful. The vets at Wizoo are so helpful, cheerful, friendly, & knowledgeable. I love how easy it is to get a timely appointment too. These vets always take the time & care for their patients. Highly recommend!",
        "time": 1765929480,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Sylvie",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/101073439519218724981/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXHKX3X52D0KSU8gYE-NLoujhJnLkvtLt91cEh9sEveCfZ-d10=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "a month ago",
        "text": "Brought my Frenchie for pain he was having on a Sunday night and was able to get an appointment for Monday. Staff was awesome. Vet, Dr. Feeby D. was wonderful. Full diagnosis with X-rays. Very affordable compared to other places. I didn't have to wait to be seen like at other places where you sit around for more than half an hour. This is the second dog, and visit for me. Very consistent service.",
        "time": 1768247575,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Jordan Francisco",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/114151981913314895978/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWDvPuJ86E5To5uqUFeonLX6uiYLr9WiNrQdDNyOmAGaLl34ysF=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 1,
        "relative_time_description": "4 months ago",
        "text": "I decided to visit this vet clinic based on their online listing claiming they'd be open from 9am to 5pm. We went there specifically to pick up food for our sick animal, and I wasted a full 30 minutes driving there, only to arrive and find the place closed. Their own door sign even confirms those exact hours, but nope—doors locked, lights off, and not a single note or explanation posted anywhere. If they can't even bother to update their hours or communicate properly, how on earth can anyone trust them with their pet's health?",
        "time": 1759091239,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Avnoor Dhillon",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/104759379567775498325/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocKu2Gl1mQxQYDtZUsbJUviCsLgDsZQXH8T7KvUnRGIWhATwug=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "2 months ago",
        "text": "I had an amazing experience at wizoo! The whole team was incredibly kind, patient, and reassuring from start to finish. They took their time explaining everything clearly and treated my pet with so much care and compassion. You can really tell they love what they do. The clinic feels welcoming, the service is smooth, and I left feeling confident that my pet was in the best hands possible. I highly recommend to anyone looking for a trustworthy vet.",
        "time": 1765062540,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Tally Curiel",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/110137323325957113337/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVZzIvqqdPu2iSjY8WwZsBCDmRsk7LA7bJRUVJYz5Rb-KUTHkYu=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
